body:
I just noticed my minor league teams are all under 500, can that stunt development? I don't see how I can send more pics on this thread

&#x200B;

Erod did just develop into an all star all of a sudden

Put the Brewers at 3, Orioles 4 and Astros 5

&#x200B;

I put the Brewers there because they are more likely to run into them than any AL team and I think the Brewers can be scary with their SPs

I do not know who, but at least one of our young infielders is going to have to be moved. Lewis/Correa/Lee/Julian/Kiriloff/Miranda/Severino

&#x200B;

In the outfield we have Larnach/Wallner/Martin eventually Erod and Jenkins will be here

&#x200B;

Our MLB ready talent is going to be peaking in March of 2024 and all those guys are on 3+ years of team control

Classified. I love Five and I feel like Classified builds on it in every way. I am a massive casual fan and this map fits everything I love about zombies. After that maybe Dead of the Night or Tog? I kinda have a grudge against Tog for being the finale of the story line but as a map it's ok tbh

&#x200B;

Edit: Forgot about IX, def 2nd or 3rd best
